## Formal ontology mappings

- **FOAF** `foaf:member` (reversed direction) — semantic match
- **ORG** (W3C Organization Ontology) `org:memberOf` — exact semantic match (the source standard)
- **SIOC** `sioc:has_subscriber` (reversed) — sibling formulation for community-of-practice
- **vCard** `vcard:org` (single org case) — distant analogue

Grounding references in the corpus:
- [`references/org_ontology_reference.md`](../references/org_ontology_reference.md) — W3C ORG vocabulary

## Inverse-of relation

`belongs-to` is the canonical inverse of `has-member`.  When `:dt/inverse-of :mm.organization/has-member` is declared, the substrate's prp-inv1/inv2 entailment derives both directions.

